    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Destiny's Sports Page\r\n\r\nIn this level, we're going to help Destiny, who is struggling with her use of AI. Here is what she says:\r\n\r\n*\"I can barely read anything on my page. I wanted it to look bold and dramatic with the team colors, but now the text and the background are basically the same color. I don't understand what went wrong.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Read Destiny's `vision.md` file in the file explorer to understand what she asked for\r\n2) Decide how you want to fix it. You can update the `vision.md` file to be more specific and have AI Tutor regenerate the page, or go step-by-step with AI Tutor to fix the issues.\r\n\r\nKeep working with AI Tutor until you think the webpage addresses Destiny's feedback. Once it does: press the Continue button!\r\n\r\n**Hint:** Look at how Destiny described the colors in her vision. Think about how you can separate the background color from the text color so they don't conflict - being specific about which element gets which color will help.",
