        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <style>\n      body {\n        background-color: #003366;\n        color: #003366;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        padding: 1rem;\n      }\n      h1 {\n        color: #ffd700;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Westview Wolves</h1>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Team History</h2>\n      <p>The Westview Wolves have been a staple of local basketball since 1987. Known for their fast-paced play and strong defense, the Wolves have won three regional championships in the last decade.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Starting Players</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Marcus T. — Point Guard</li>\n        <li>Jordan S. — Shooting Guard</li>\n        <li>Priya N. — Small Forward</li>\n        <li>DeShawn W. — Power Forward</li>\n        <li>Aaliyah R. — Center</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>",
